      tolerance: 0.01,
      kind: "nat",
      marks: 1,
      explanation: "Each I/O operation (the one scanf plus the 20 printf calls inside the loop) causes the process to leave and later re-enter the ready queue, giving 1 + 20 = 21 re-entries into the ready queue."
