      section: "CS",
      q: "Consider the following two languages over the alphabet {a, b}: L1 = {αβα | α ∈ {a,b}⁺ AND β ∈ {a,b}⁺}. L2 = {αβα | α ∈ {a}⁺ AND β ∈ {a,b}⁺}. Which ONE of the following statements is CORRECT?",
      options: ["Both L1 and L2 are regular languages.","L1 is a regular language but L2 is not a regular language.","L1 is not a regular language but L2 is a regular language.","Neither L1 nor L2 is a regular language."],
