      section: "CS",
      q: "Consider the following database tables of a sports league.\nplayer(pid, pname, age)          team(tid, tname, city, cid)\ncoach(cid, cname)                members(pid, tid)\n\nAn instance of the tables:\nplayer: (1,Jasprit,31) (2,Atharva,24) (3,Ishan,26) (4,Axar,30)\ncoach: (101,Ricky) (102,Mark) (103,Trevor)\nteam: (10,MI,Mumbai,102) (20,DC,Delhi,101) (30,PK,Mohali,103)\nmembers: (1,10) (2,30) (3,10) (4,20)\n\nSELECT MIN(P.age)\nFROM player P\nWHERE P.pid IN (\n    SELECT M.pid\n    FROM team T, coach C, members M\n    WHERE C.cname = 'Mark'\n        AND T.cid = C.cid\n        AND M.tid = T.tid\n)\n\nThe value returned by the given SQL query is ________. (Answer in integer)",
      options: [],
