      q: "Consider the given sequential circuit designed using D-Flip-flops (D0-D3 feed Q0-Q3, connected in series Q0→D1, Q1→D2, Q2→D3, and the complemented output Q3' feeds back into D0). The circuit is initialized with some value (initial state). The number of distinct states the circuit will go through before returning back to the initial state is ________. (Answer in integer)",
      figure: "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 220\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:420px;height:auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><rect x=\"20\" y=\"60\" width=\"70\" height=\"80\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"60\" width=\"70\" height=\"80\"/><rect x=\"240\" y=\"60\" width=\"70\" height=\"80\"/><rect x=\"350\" y=\"60\" width=\"70\" height=\"80\"/><path d=\"M35,90 L50,60 L65,90\" /><path d=\"M145,90 L160,60 L175,90\" /><path d=\"M255,90 L270,60 L285,90\" /><path d=\"M365,90 L380,60 L395,90\" /><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"70\"/><line x1=\"200\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"70\"/><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"70\"/><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"70\"/><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"130\"/><line x1=\"430\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"20\"/><line x1=\"430\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"20\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"20\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"70\" marker-end=\"url(#ah2025cs60)\"/><circle cx=\"425\" cy=\"130\" r=\"4\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"55\" y2=\"185\"/><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"165\" y2=\"185\"/><line x1=\"275\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"275\" y2=\"185\"/><line x1=\"385\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"185\"/><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"185\" x2=\"385\" y2=\"185\"/></g><g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"currentColor\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"102\">D0</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"102\">D1</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"102\">D2</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"102\">D3</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"68\">Q0</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"68\">Q1</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"68\">Q2</text><text x=\"398\" y=\"68\">Q3</text><text x=\"66\" y=\"128\">Q0'</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"128\">Q1'</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"128\">Q2'</text><text x=\"396\" y=\"128\">Q3'</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"182\">CLK</text></g><defs><marker id=\"ah2025cs60\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></marker></defs></svg>",
