      q: "#include <stdio.h>\nint foo(int S[], int size) {\n  if (size == 0) return 0;\n  if (size == 1) return 1;\n  if (S[0] != S[1]) return 1+foo(S+1, size-1);\n  return foo(S+1, size-1);\n}\nint main() {\n  int A[] = {0,1,2,2,2,0,0,1,1};\n  printf(\"%d\", foo(A,9));\n  return 0;\n}\nThe value printed by the given C program is _______. (Answer in integer)",
